WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.441
"Sid!" Tor cried.

2
00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:13.599
"You ruined our paintings!"

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.085
Sid hung his head.

4
00:00:16.086 --> 00:00:26.568
"Sorry," he said.

5
00:00:26.569 --> 00:00:30.014
Sara smiled and patted Sid.

6
00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:31.852
"Don't worry.

7
00:00:31.853 --> 00:00:35.508
My painting looks better now."

8
00:00:35.509 --> 00:00:38.598
"Really?" Sid asked.

9
00:00:38.599 --> 00:00:51.220
"Yep!" Sara said.

10
00:00:51.221 --> 00:00:53.955
Tor frowned.

11
00:00:53.956 --> 00:00:57.353
" My painting looks bad

12
00:00:57.354 --> 00:01:01.327
now. And it was the best

13
00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:09.655
one!" "Our paintings were good too," Rex

14
00:01:09.656 --> 00:01:20.002
said. "Mine was better!" Tor said. "Much better!"

15
00:01:20.003 --> 00:01:22.954
Finally, Rex got mad.

16
00:01:22.955 --> 00:01:27.573
He took a deep, deep breath.

17
00:01:27.574 --> 00:01:32.440
"Roar!"

18
00:01:32.441 --> 00:01:37.052
The cave shook.

19
00:01:37.053 --> 00:01:39.842
Paint sprayed on Sid and Tor.

20
00:01:39.843 --> 00:01:44.571
"Grr!" Tor threw paint.

21
00:01:44.572 --> 00:01:46.423
It missed Rex.

22
00:01:46.424 --> 00:01:49.262
"Look out, Sid!" Sara said.

23
00:01:49.263 --> 00:01:53.706
Sid swung his tail. Splat!

24
00:01:53.707 --> 00:01:57.014
"Sid!" Rex yelled.

25
00:01:57.015 --> 00:01:59.856
"You got paint on me!"

26
00:01:59.857 --> 00:02:05.739
Rex, Sid, and Tor all threw paint.

27
00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:08.369
Sara held up her arms.

28
00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:12.232
"Everybody, stop!"

